<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #0f172a;
      padding: 32px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .intro {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 24px;
      color: #475569;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .badge-single {
      background-color: #dbeafe;
      color: #1d4ed8;
    }
    .badge-package {
      background-color: #fef3c7;
      color: #b45309;
    }
    .card {
      background-color: #f1f5f9;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .card-title {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .detail-row {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #475569;
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 200px;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .session-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .session-table th {
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #64748b;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .session-table td {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #334155;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
    }
    .session-table tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .confirm-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #1d4ed8;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 40px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }
    .confirm-btn:hover {
      background-color: #1e40af;
    }
    .warning-box {
      background-color: #fef3c7;
      border: 1px solid #fbbf24;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #92400e;
      line-height: 20px;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>EASYSLOTING</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p class="greeting">Olá, <%= html_escape(@customer.name) %>!</p>
        <p class="intro">Seu agendamento é em <strong>1 hora</strong>. Por favor, confirme sua presença para garantir seu horário.</p>

        <% if @is_package %>
          <span class="badge badge-package">Pacote Mensal</span>
        <% else %>
          <span class="badge badge-single">Serviço Avulso</span>
        <% end %>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">Informações do Estabelecimento</div>
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">Nome:</span>
            <span class="detail-value"><%= html_escape(@establishment.name) %></span>
          </div>
          <% if @establishment.address.present? %>
            <div class="detail-row">
              <span class="detail-label">Endereço:</span>
              <span class="detail-value"><%= html_escape([@establishment.address.street, @establishment.address.number, @establishment.address.neighborhood, @establishment.address.city].compact.join(', ')) %></span>
            </div>
          <% end %>
          <% if @establishment.phone.present? %>
            <div class="detail-row">
              <span class="detail-label">Telefone:</span>
              <span class="detail-value"><%= html_escape(@establishment.phone) %></span>
            </div>
          <% end %>
          <% if @establishment.whatsapp.present? %>
            <div class="detail-row">
              <span class="detail-label">WhatsApp:</span>
              <span class="detail-value"><%= html_escape(@establishment.whatsapp) %></span>
            </div>
          <% end %>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">Detalhes do Agendamento</div>
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">Serviço:</span>
            <span class="detail-value"><%= html_escape(@service.name) %></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">Profissional:</span>
            <span class="detail-value"><%= html_escape(@employee.name) %></span>
          </div>

          <% if @is_package && @package %>
            <div class="detail-row">
              <span class="detail-label">Pacote:</span>
              <span class="detail-value"><%= html_escape(@package.name) %> (<%= @package.sessions_total %> sessões)</span>
            </div>
          <% end %>

          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">Tipo:</span>
            <span class="detail-value"><%= @is_package ? 'Pacote Mensal' : 'Serviço Avulso' %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">Duração:</span>
            <span class="detail-value"><%= @service.duration_minutes %> minutos</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">Horário do Atendimento</div>
          <table class="session-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Data</th>
                <th>Horário</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><%= @appointment.appointment_date.strftime('%d/%m/%Y') %></td>
                <td><%= @appointment.start_time.respond_to?(:strftime) ? @appointment.start_time.strftime('%H:%M') : @appointment.start_time.to_s[0, 5] %></td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <a href="<%= ENV.fetch('FRONTEND_URL', 'http://localhost:5173') %>/empresa/<%= @slug %>/meus-agendamentos" class="confirm-btn">
            Confirmar Presença
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="warning-box">
          <strong>Importante:</strong> Caso não possa ir no dia, utilize o botão "Reagendar" para escolher outro horário.
        </div>

      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>Este é um e-mail automático enviado pela plataforma EasySloting. Por favor, não responda diretamente a esta mensagem.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
